    "detailed_description": "<strong>Gloomgeons</strong> is a retro style 3D first person perspective game that combines the nostalgia of legend FPS games with the dungeons exploration. Step into a mysterious world of skeletons, wizards and golems. Unlock four weapons, collect treasure and find secret rooms. The game consists of 24 levels divided into 3 parts.<br><br><strong>Controls:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> W A S D - move<br></li><li> Space or E - activate<br></li><li> Mouse - look and shoot<br></li><li> Shift - run<br></li><li> 1 2 3 4 - select weapon</li></ul>",
